#: ../../source/crowdin-cli_README.md:4
msgid "Downloading content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/crowdin-cli_README.md:5
msgid ""
"Download the translated content for the project. You could download "
"specific language, or download all languages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/crowdin-cli_README.md:7
msgid ""
"Use command below to download all translated content for the project "
"configured in the ./crowdin.yaml file. Content will be saved in the "
"`all.zip`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/crowdin-cli_README.md:11
msgid "Use `-o` parameter to change output file for the downloaded content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/crowdin-cli_README.md:15
msgid ""
"Use `-l` parameter to download only selected language. Download only "
"Russian language and save it to ru.zip."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/crowdin-cli_README.md:19
msgid "You could use `-o` and `-l` together."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/crowdin-cli_README.md:24
msgid "Exporting content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/crowdin-cli_README.md:25
msgid ""
"Crowdin cache translated content which could be downloaded. To be able to"
" access the latest translation you have to export translation. After that"
" all subsequent copy for downloading will use same exported copy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/crowdin-cli_README.md:28
msgid ""
"Use command below to export content for the project configured in the "
"./crowdin.yaml file."
msgstr ""

